### Subscription API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get Available Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get Current Subscription
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/current
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Create Subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/create
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "planId": "plan_basic_monthly",
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_card_visa"
}

### 4. Update Subscription Plan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/update
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "planId": "plan_premium_monthly"
}

### 5. Cancel Subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "No longer needed",
  "cancelAtPeriodEnd": true
}

### 6. Resume Subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Billing History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/billing/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Get Upcoming Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/billing/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Download Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/billing/invoice/invoice_id_here/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Update Payment Method
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/payment-method
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_card_mastercard"
}

### 11. Get Usage Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Apply Coupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subscription/coupon
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE20"
}